    "commit_body": "W60-dominant prior_signal (TAU=40, MAG_EXP=0.70, SIG_NORM=3.0, SIG_MIN=0.20).\n97 promotions over 5y; promoted-cohort TP% 62.2% vs 75+ baseline 61.02%.\nQ1 ship gate PASS (+0.01pp on 75+ TP%). Per-trade gate is the correct ship\ncriterion for scoring changes (not MC, per assessment-backtest.md).\n\nNo-cascade: weight_info['pre_boost'] snapshots score before lift so future\nprior lookups use raw pre-boost values, not the elevated Score.overall.\nBarrier wins loaded from .cache/barrier_outcomes.db (30dte_generic, low side,\nW7/15/30/60). Prior_signal pre-computed per stock/date in batch scoring\nfunctions using v32 DB overalls as no-cascade priors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
